== A. product-formula (Liouville) bound and heights of periodic points ==
ok: Liouville bound v2(n - beta) <= log2((n+1) H(beta)) on 23994 (n, beta) pairs, including 12000 pairs with n 2-adically close to beta (max slack -7.087)
ok: H(x_w) <= 3^(a-1) 2^p for all 32752 words of length <= 14 with a >= 1; max log2 H / p = 1.5426 < log2 6 = 2.5850
