ok: in 1685 shadow steps (cycles -1, -5, O_5, O_7, -17): y_j = (3^a_j/2^j) y_0, v2 drops by j, v3 of the numerator rises by a_j, the prime-to-6 part and the denominator are invariant, and the local log-changes at infinity, 2, 3 sum to 0
